    seen in the descriptions of individuals born under Saturn's influence. The text also
    notes that Saturn is associated with a lack of self-possessed behavior and a
    tendency toward deceit and dishonesty, as seen in the descriptions of Saturn in
    Taurus, Gemini, and other signs.

  --- REFERENCE (ground truth) ---
    The text describes Saturn as a natural malefic and the most dreaded planet among
